      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "From \\(x-y\\gt x\\) we get \\(-y\\gt0,\\) so \\(y\\lt0.\\) From \\(x+y\\lt y\\) we get \\(x\\lt0.\\)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is D.",
